                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Transfer is the Mac companion to the console, so it keeps the Segno mark and inverts the console icon's colours: black mark on the light #F2F2F0 (the site's dark-mode mark colour) where the console has a white mark on black. The two read as one family side by side in the Dock, and the light one is the Mac app."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
