                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The download glyph (arrow onto a tray) under the mark says what the app does: it brings performances from the appliance to this Mac. It uses round caps and a 40 pt stroke, close to the weight of the mark's slash, and stays readable at 32 px."
              }
            ],
