                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The board is the 1024 pt Icon Composer canvas. The repo ships it as apps\/segno_transfer\/AppIcon.icon: the background is the icon's fill, the mark and the glyph are one layer at 0.88 scale (the console icon's), and macOS applies the rounded mask and glass."
